  "caveat": "The registered disattenuated ISI is UNDEFINED under scorer='ssgsea': the audit estimates reliability with the general-form Cronbach alpha for a mean-of-z-scores composite, which an ssGSEA rank-walk score is not, so alpha collapses to 0 and every draw is dropped. This is a property of the reliability estimator, not of ssGSEA. Arms 1 and 3 are the comparable ones."
